	(text "DESIGN CONVENTIONS\n───────────────────────────────────────────────\nNET NAMING\n  Power     +5V  +3V3  +1V8  (suffix _A for analog)\n  Ground    GND  AGND  PGND  (join at one point only)\n  Signal    <FUNC>_<SIGNAL>   SPI1_SCK  I2C2_SDA\n  Active-low  suffix _N       RESET_N  CS_N\n  Diff pair   suffix _P / _N  USB_DP  USB_DN\n  Format    UPPERCASE, A-Z 0-9 _ only, no spaces\n\nSCHEMATIC STYLE\n  Flow      Inputs left, outputs right, VCC top, GND bottom\n  Grid      50 mil, wires orthogonal, junction dot at 3+ ways\n  Unused    X no-connect marker on every unused pin\n\nREFERENCE DESIGNATORS\n  R C L  passive   D diode/LED   Q transistor   U IC\n  FB ferrite   CN connector  SW switch   TP test point   H mounting hole\n\nUNITS\n  Ω kΩ MΩ  |  pF nF µF  |  nH µH  |  V A mA  |  Hz kHz MHz\n  4k7 = 4.7 kΩ   100n = 100 nF   0R = 0 Ω link\n\nCOMPONENTS\n  Every part: Value, Footprint, MFR, MFR.P/N\n───────────────────────────────────────────────"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
